        },
        {
          "text": " “Na ŋes aicorakinet naka ekisil naeeoraki EJAKAIT ebe, Kinera kidwe luka Isirael, koinut jo ataok nakarenan naemamei akemer, komam eŋwalit, namam eut edakit aiookot: ",
