                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ŋmitunanan yenetirori akuan nakatwan naka ituŋanan yenetwanit, komam italauni akekuan, etisilian nm ewema lokalaunan loka EJAKAIT; ido egelario ituŋanan ŋin koIsirael: naarai mam ŋes aponi kobwatakinai akipi nuitesegaarete, eraun yenimam elai; esalakini amamus ailake mamake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
